    "agent 停下来等你回答时，电脑会经 Apple 的推送服务在灵动岛和锁屏上提醒你，Runode 不用开着；屏幕上的问题文字也会经推送服务转达。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When an agent stops to wait for your answer, your Mac alerts you in the Dynamic Island and on the Lock Screen through Apple's push service, even with Runode closed. The question on screen is also sent through the push service."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "agent 停下来等你回答时，电脑会经 Apple 的推送服务在灵动岛和锁屏上提醒你，Runode 不用开着；屏幕上的问题文字也会经推送服务转达。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "agent 停下來等你回答時，電腦會經 Apple 的推播服務在動態島和鎖定畫面上提醒你，Runode 不用開著；螢幕上的問題文字也會經推播服務轉達。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "agent 问你问题时在灵动岛提醒" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
