    "未跟踪的文件会从电脑上删掉，丢掉的改动找不回来。已暂存的改动不受影响。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Untracked files will be deleted from the Mac, and discarded changes can't be recovered. Staged changes are not affected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未跟踪的文件会从电脑上删掉，丢掉的改动找不回来。已暂存的改动不受影响。"
