    "点上面的按钮打开扫码，对准电脑屏幕上的二维码。配好后电脑就出现在这里。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap the button above to scan, and point the camera at the QR code on your Mac's screen. Once paired, your Mac appears here."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点上面的按钮打开扫码，对准电脑屏幕上的二维码。配好后电脑就出现在这里。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "點上面的按鈕開啟掃碼，對準電腦螢幕上的 QR 碼。配好後電腦就會出現在這裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
