    "现在没连着这台电脑，它上面的 agent 等回答时可能还会推送到这部手机，可以在那台电脑上运行 `runode remote revoke %@` 撤销配对。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This phone isn't connected to the Mac right now, so agents there may still send notifications here when they're waiting for an answer. Run `runode remote revoke %@` on that Mac to revoke the pairing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "现在没连着这台电脑，它上面的 agent 等回答时可能还会推送到这部手机，可以在那台电脑上运行 `runode remote revoke %@` 撤销配对。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "現在沒連著這台電腦，它上面的 agent 等回答時可能還會推送到這部手機，可以在那台電腦上執行 `runode remote revoke %@` 撤銷配對。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "电脑" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mac"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "电脑"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "電腦"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "电脑上提到这部手机时用这个名字，比如终端尺寸由谁决定。下次连上电脑时生效；电脑上已配对设备列表里的名字是配对时的，重新配对后才会更新。留空用系统的名字。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This name is used when the Mac refers to this phone, for example to show who sets a terminal's size. It takes effect the next time you connect to the Mac. The name in the Mac's paired devices list is the one from pairing and only updates after you pair again. Leave empty to use the system name."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "电脑上提到这部手机时用这个名字，比如终端尺寸由谁决定。下次连上电脑时生效；电脑上已配对设备列表里的名字是配对时的，重新配对后才会更新。留空用系统的名字。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "電腦上提到這部手機時用這個名稱，比如終端機尺寸由誰決定。下次連上電腦時生效；電腦上已配對裝置清單裡的名稱是配對時的，重新配對後才會更新。留空使用系統的名稱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "电脑上没有打开远程访问" : {
