    "默认尺寸用在新打开的终端上，终端页右上角还能临时换。「自动」在电脑上没有窗口显示这个终端时适配手机，有时跟随电脑。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The default size applies to newly opened terminals; you can also change it temporarily from the top right of the terminal screen. Auto fits the phone when no window on the Mac is showing the terminal, and otherwise follows the Mac."
